  <h2 id="routes">Nine routes, led by the ones with real headroom</h2>

  <p>
    We start with the routes where skill, proof and a business layer can grow income, and end with
    the rank-gated ones. Each route shows who pays, how they find and trust you, what to watch for,
    and how to grow. Nothing is removed from the list. Crowded routes stay in, with their risk
    marked.
  </p>

  <div class="route-grid">
    {routes.map((r) => (
      <div class="route-card">
